Package: myepi
Type: Package
Title: Regression Workflows and Figures for Epidemiological Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Yuanlin Mou [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Yuanlin Mou <your_email@example.com>
Description: Streamlined analysis workflows for cohort and case-control
    studies: missing-data profiling; Cox, logistic, conditional logistic and
    linear regression with complete-case reporting and per-level descriptive
    statistics; quantile grouping with trend tests; subgroup analyses with
    interaction tests and heterogeneity statistics; restricted cubic spline
    and penalized spline dose-response curves; and publication-grade vector
    forest plots and dose-response curves with embedded fonts. Model fitting
    and inference rely on 'survival', 'stats', 'rms' and 'metafor'.
